rnal reporting channels are silent; however, if we codify robust, legally protected whistleblowing for the 100,000+ employees working on these systems, we create a non-spoofable check that no internal model, no matter how 'situationally aware,' can fully suppress. We do not need a perfect mathematical proof of safety to regulate this infrastructure. We need a liability regime that makes it prohibitively expensive for a corporation to ignore the warnings of the very people who built the machine.",
